<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gunns half-year net profit slips.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gunns half-year net profit slips.</headline>
<dateline>HOBART 1996-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  2.23 vs  5.24</p>
<p>    Net profit			  1.43 vs  3.66</p>
<p>    Sales				54.02 vs 57.33</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   3.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Gunns Ltd is a timber supplier.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
